1
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,072
好啊  宝贝弟弟
Hey, baby brother!

2
00:00:20,112 --> 00:00:22,632
我们别侮辱彼此了  你要多少钱
Let's not insult us both. How much do you need?

3
00:00:22,874 --> 00:00:24,103
妈妈帮我先付了这个月的汽车保险
Mom paid my car insurance this month,

4
00:00:24,163 --> 00:00:25,310
我跟她说我今天会有钱...
and I told her I'd have it today --

5
00:00:25,512 --> 00:00:26,498
-告诉我数字就好  -120元
- The number, the number. - $120.

6
00:00:28,028 --> 00:00:29,990
外公帮我在他的乡村俱乐部找了份工作
Grandpa got me a job at his country club,

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,531
我赚小费赚翻了
and I've been cleaning up in tips.

8
00:00:32,418 --> 00:00:33,586
我还喜欢这些人的霸气说话方式
I also like the way those guys talk.

9
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:36,607
原来有专门对挪威人的种族蔑称呢
There's actually an ethnic slur for Norwegians.

10
00:00:37,291 --> 00:00:38,479
叫冰[哔]
It's ice ers.

11
00:00:39,364 --> 00:00:40,733
儿子  他们取消来看房
Hey, buddy, they canceled my showing,

12
00:00:40,753 --> 00:00:41,910
我可以开车载你去上班了
so I can drive you to work.

13
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,453
看起来不错啊  是什么
That looks good. What is it?

14
00:00:43,715 --> 00:00:45,247
乡村俱乐部的热月龙虾
Lobster Thermidor from the country club.

15
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:47,202
冰箱里还有"樱桃盛宴"甜点
There's also cherries jubilee in the fridge.

16
00:00:49,152 --> 00:00:51,726
瞧瞧我们  像50年代的富人在吃东西
Look at us eating like rich people in the '50s.

17
00:00:51,766 --> 00:00:54,330
好啊  妈妈  祝你今天工作顺利
Hey, Mom! Have a good day at work.

18
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:56,413
我已经上完班了  都三点半了
Uh, I already did that. It's 3:30.

19
00:00:57,138 --> 00:00:58,647
你怎么能现在才刚醒
How are you just waking up?

20
00:00:58,989 --> 00:01:01,042
我把闹钟定在了中午  我肯定是睡过去了
I set my alarm for noon. I must have slept through it.

21
00:01:01,123 --> 00:01:02,655
我工作得很晚  为一家新的酒吧宣传
I was working late promoting a new club.

22
00:01:02,756 --> 00:01:05,730
对了  这是汽车保险的钱
Oh, by the way, here is the insurance money.

23
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:08,106
-谢谢  -里面有很多一元纸币啊
- Thank you. - A lot of singles in there.

24
00:01:08,147 --> 00:01:09,390
你到底在这个酒吧做什么"工作"
What exactly do you do at this club?

25
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,065
对对对
Oh, right.

26
00:01:10,588 --> 00:01:11,675
因为我是脱衣舞女  艾丽克斯
'Cause I'm a stripper, Alex.

27
00:01:13,508 --> 00:01:15,330
天啊  你们真觉得我是个脱衣舞女吗
Oh, my God, do you really think I'm a stripper?

28
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,247
-不觉得  -不觉得
- No. - No.

29
00:01:17,134 --> 00:01:18,304
好了  我走了
Okay, well, I'm off.

30
00:01:18,465 --> 00:01:19,574
我要去社区大学
I'm signing up for some business classes

31
00:01:19,634 --> 00:01:20,390
报名参加一些商务课
at community college.

32
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,991
商务课啊
Business class, huh?

33
00:01:22,676 --> 00:01:24,509
看来有人受到了影响啊
Sounds like somebody's been influenced

34
00:01:24,590 --> 00:01:26,100
因为她和一个行业巨头
by living under the same roof

35
00:01:26,363 --> 00:01:28,382
住在同一个屋檐下
with a certain captain of industry.

36
00:01:28,462 --> 00:01:29,997
谢谢你  亲爱的  但要不是
Thank you, honey, but none of my success

37
00:01:30,017 --> 00:01:32,639
有你照顾家并支持我  我也不可能成功
would have been possible without your support as a homemaker.

38
00:01:33,144 --> 00:01:34,798
亲爱的  你突然对商业感兴趣了
Sweetheart, while I'm very flattered

39
00:01:34,818 --> 00:01:36,574
我真是觉得很荣幸
by your sudden interest in business,

40
00:01:36,654 --> 00:01:38,995
但你还是别再上课了  而是找份工作吧
how about instead of another class, you get a job?

41
00:01:39,076 --> 00:01:40,248
把手弄脏[亲自干活]吧
Get your hands a little dirty, huh?

42
00:01:40,511 --> 00:01:41,644
她可以用手抓抓头发
She could run her hands through her hair.

43
00:01:41,705 --> 00:01:43,686
-那就脏了  -我已经预注册了
- That would do it. - I've already pre-registered.

44
00:01:43,848 --> 00:01:45,462
我还报名了今晚的签售会
Also, I signed us up for that book signing tonight.

45
00:01:45,483 --> 00:01:45,947
你还来吗
You still in?

46
00:01:46,270 --> 00:01:47,017
绝对的
Absolutely.

47
00:01:47,037 --> 00:01:48,190
我的书就在这
Got my book right here.

48
00:01:48,230 --> 00:01:49,971
-想把这本书弄成你看过的样子吗  -外行
- Trying to make it look like you read it? - Amateur.

49
00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:09,395
我的工作没有职称
So, I don't really have a job title

50
00:02:09,435 --> 00:02:11,166
也没有固定的工作地点
or even a set place to work,

51
00:02:11,206 --> 00:02:12,978
所以我就转来转去
so I kind of just float around

52
00:02:13,038 --> 00:02:14,431
确保所有人得到了需要的东西
and make sure everyone has what they need.

53
00:02:15,844 --> 00:02:16,147
四点了  法官大人
4:00, Your Honor.

54
00:02:16,187 --> 00:02:17,540
别忘了吃药
Don't forget to take your medicine.

55
00:02:19,788 --> 00:02:20,959
这都是有权有势的人
Well, all these powerful guys.

56
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,030
你可以在这里积累永恒的人脉
You can make connections here that'll last forever.

57
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:24,068
也不行
Not really.

58
00:02:24,088 --> 00:02:25,499
这里经常有人去世
We have a lot of turnover here.

59
00:02:25,519 --> 00:02:28,370
从四月以来  外面就一直在降半旗
That flag outside has been at half-mast since April.

60
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:29,608
所以才有这个
That's why we have these.

61
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,123
这是怎么回事
Oh. How's that work?

62
00:02:32,707 --> 00:02:34,397
你找个会员为你担保
You find a member to sponsor you,

63
00:02:34,498 --> 00:02:35,689
过来跟委员会喝点酒
come have some drinks with the committee,

64
00:02:35,750 --> 00:02:36,801
他们会投票选出一些新会员
and they vote a few people in.

65
00:02:37,064 --> 00:02:39,307
跟我曾加入的秘密拉拉队组织程序差不多
Similar process to a secret cheer society I was in.

66
00:02:39,367 --> 00:02:40,295
骷髅头和拉拉队绒球
Skull and Pom-Poms.

67
00:02:40,940 --> 00:02:41,848
我已经泄露太多了
I've said too much already.

68
00:02:41,888 --> 00:02:43,320
你想加入吗
Are you thinking of joining?

69
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,192
我的两个合作伙伴都在俱乐部里
Both my partners are in clubs.

70
00:02:45,233 --> 00:02:46,504
他们招徕了许多生意
They've drummed up a lot of business.

71
00:02:46,565 --> 00:02:47,352
也许我...
Maybe I --

72
00:02:47,372 --> 00:02:48,602
那是杰  也许他可以
Hey, there's Jay. Maybe he can --

73
00:02:48,723 --> 00:02:49,788
杰  杰
Jay. Jay!

74
00:02:50,270 --> 00:02:51,456
杰杰杰
Jay, Jay, Jay!

75
00:02:52,099 --> 00:02:53,225
快走
Go, go, go!

76
00:02:53,627 --> 00:02:54,290
杰  等等
Jay, wait up!

77
00:02:54,993 --> 00:02:56,159
我觉得有人在叫你
I think someone's calling for you.

78
00:02:56,179 --> 00:02:57,246
我什么都没听见  这车怎么了
I didn't hear anything. What's wrong with this cart?

79
00:02:57,468 --> 00:02:59,523
-你踩了刹车吗  快啊  -你的钉鞋
- You got the brakes on? Go! - Ow! Your spikes.

80
00:03:00,349 --> 00:03:01,850
跑太快有点抽筋了
Hey, hey, hey! Cramps.

81
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:03,574
卢克和我刚一起吃了一块威灵顿牛排
Luke and I just split a Beef Wellington

82
00:03:03,614 --> 00:03:04,482
和卡西诺烧蛤
and clams casino.

83
00:03:05,046 --> 00:03:06,750
我想知道你能否为我担保
Um, I'm wondering if you'd, uh, sponsor me

84
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,053
让我参加今晚的新会员派对
for the new-members thing tonight.

85
00:03:08,215 --> 00:03:09,346
天啊  我很乐意  但他们有规定
Gee, I'd like to, but they got rules

86
00:03:09,427 --> 00:03:11,285
亲戚不能为新会员担保  所以
about relatives sponsoring new members, so --

87
00:03:11,366 --> 00:03:12,598
他们没有  我就这样做了
No, they don't. I just did it.

88
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,708
天啊  他们肯定是改规定了
Gee, they must have changed that.

89
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:15,708
真棒  今晚见  我该几点来
Oh, great, I'll see you tonight. What time should I be here?

90
00:03:16,052 --> 00:03:16,800
我想大概九点半开始吧
Oh, I think it starts about 9:30.

91
00:03:17,285 --> 00:03:19,224
不  那时候就结束了  七点开始
No, it'll be over by then. It starts at 7:00.

92
00:03:19,688 --> 00:03:20,656
他们肯定也改时间了
They must have changed that, too.

93
00:03:20,696 --> 00:03:22,168
谢谢你  杰  七点见
Thanks, Jay. See you at 7:00.

94
00:03:22,995 --> 00:03:24,787
等等  那是克莱尔的丈夫对吧
Wait, that was Claire's husband, right?

95
00:03:24,868 --> 00:03:27,726
是的  安德斯  你个傻逼冰[哔]
Yes, it was, Anders, you stupid ice

96
00:03:27,746 --> 00:03:30,523
六个月来  我从来没机会独处一晚
I haven't had one night to myself in six months,

97
00:03:31,006 --> 00:03:33,380
但今晚  曼尼要去参加派对
but tonight, Manny's going to a party.

98
00:03:33,763 --> 00:03:36,298
如果我能让乔累到睡觉
And if I can get Joe tired enough to go to sleep,

99
00:03:36,318 --> 00:03:39,676
我就终于可以放松  洗个长长的舒服澡了
I can finally relax and take a long, nice bath.

100
00:03:40,439 --> 00:03:42,852
我还有一个能浮起来的酒杯
I even have a wine glass that floats.

101
00:03:43,173 --> 00:03:46,010
就算我睡著了  也不会发生糟糕的事
In case I fall asleep, nothing bad can happen.

102
00:03:47,279 --> 00:03:48,447
好了  小驯鹿
Ohh. Okay, little reindeer,

103
00:03:48,487 --> 00:03:50,340
我们还没到北极呢
we didn't get to the North Pole yet.

104
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:54,276
我不想玩这个游戏了
I'm tired of this game.

105
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,314
我们得把这食物送给圣诞老人
Well, we need to take this food to Santa Claus.

106
00:03:57,354 --> 00:03:58,784
如果不送  他就会饿死
If not, he's gonna starve to death.

107
00:03:59,268 --> 00:04:00,014
我该穿哪件参加派对
Which shirt for the party --

108
00:04:00,176 --> 00:04:01,587
淡黄色还是黄水仙色
the canary or the daffodil?

109
00:04:01,708 --> 00:04:02,818
别又来了
We're not doing this again.

110
00:04:02,838 --> 00:04:05,555
我刚帮你决定了背心是选人字呢还是粗花呢
I just did the herringbone or the tweed for your vest.

111
00:04:05,595 --> 00:04:07,004
随便选一件然后去吧
Just pick one and go.

112
00:04:07,024 --> 00:04:09,730
好吧  这件需要熨烫
Okay. Oh, well, this needs ironing.

113
00:04:09,740 --> 00:04:10,945
好吧  上车
Okay, jump on.

114
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:14,353
驯鹿鲁道夫  去洗衣房
Rudolph, to the laundry room!

115
00:04:16,848 --> 00:04:18,233
我知道这只是社区剧场
I know it's just community theater,

116
00:04:18,273 --> 00:04:20,030
但是首映夜真是令人激动啊
but aren't opening nights so exciting?

117
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,309
是啊  社会精英
Yes, the cream of society

118
00:04:21,370 --> 00:04:22,860
-穿上最好看的人字拖  -米奇尔
- decked out in their finest flip-flops. - Mitchell.

119
00:04:24,089 --> 00:04:25,690
天啊  我真不敢相信
Oh, my God, I can't believe it.

120
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:28,154
高中后我就没见过你了
I haven't seen you since high school!

121
00:04:28,556 --> 00:04:31,312
是的  好多年了对吧  泰咪
Uh, yes, it's been years, huh, uh, T-T-Tammy.

122
00:04:31,332 --> 00:04:32,810
如果你想
Hey, let me know

123
00:04:32,820 --> 00:04:34,939
再跟我去看台下面"滚"几圈  告诉我一声
if you want to roll around under the bleachers again, doll.

124
00:04:36,633 --> 00:04:37,985
好奇怪  感觉我应该能记住她这样的啊
That's weird -- I feel like I would've remembered her.

125
00:04:38,408 --> 00:04:40,324
-她为什么要贴著名牌啊  -我不知道
- Why was she wearing a name tag? - I don't know.

126
00:04:40,344 --> 00:04:41,231
是你啊
Oh, there he is!

127
00:04:41,272 --> 00:04:42,664
还记得我们玩乐队的时候
Remember that time in band

128
00:04:42,684 --> 00:04:43,977
你把笛子掉进水沟那次吗
when you dropped your flute in the gutter?

129
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:46,160
抱歉  我从来没吹过长笛之类的
I'm sorry -- I never played the flute or anything --

130
00:04:47,283 --> 00:04:48,027
老水沟吹笛手
Ha! Old gutter flute.

131
00:04:50,521 --> 00:04:51,386
好吧  这到底怎么回事
Okay, what is going on?

132
00:04:51,426 --> 00:04:52,794
为什么所有人都在跟我说话
Why is everyone talking to me?

133
00:04:52,834 --> 00:04:54,929
-我猜他们只是表达善意  -小卡  天啊
- I think they're just being friendly. - Cam, oh, my God.

134
00:04:54,949 --> 00:04:57,531
这是那种互动式剧院吗
Is -- is this one of those interactive theater experiences?

135
00:04:57,551 --> 00:04:59,829
你是说那种观众参与其中的
Oh, do you mean where the audience participates

136
00:04:59,971 --> 00:05:01,906
故意模糊表演者
and the line between performer and spectator

137
00:05:02,692 --> 00:05:03,650
和观众之间的界限的美好表演吗
is delightfully blurred?

138
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:06,822
米奇尔  这是一个高中同学会
Mitchell, we're at a high-school reunion!

139
00:05:06,842 --> 00:05:08,534
别装了  好吗  你已经骗到我了
Stop pretending, all right? You tricked me.

140
00:05:08,756 --> 00:05:10,231
-我没有  -你老是骗我
- I did not. - You always trick me.

141
00:05:10,271 --> 00:05:11,082
我们每次出门
Every time we leave the house,

142
00:05:11,102 --> 00:05:12,115
都像是在跟诈欺师斗智斗勇
it's like a game of Three-card Monte.

143
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:14,557
互动式剧院很有意思
Interactive theater is fun.

144
00:05:14,597 --> 00:05:15,908
没意思  一点意思都没有
It's not fun. It's never fun.

145
00:05:15,928 --> 00:05:17,360
这是人类在和平时期所能遇到的
It's the worst thing that can happen to human

146
00:05:17,378 --> 00:05:18,150
最糟糕的事
during peace time.

147
00:05:18,168 --> 00:05:18,774
好吧  米奇尔
Okay, you know what, Mitchell?

148
00:05:19,117 --> 00:05:20,450
拜托  我是管理层的人
Please, I'm on the board,

149
00:05:20,591 --> 00:05:21,763
别人的亲密爱人都开心出席
and I couldn't not bring my husband

150
00:05:21,783 --> 00:05:23,579
我怎么能不把我丈夫
while everyone else's significant other

151
00:05:23,599 --> 00:05:25,274
带来呢
is happy to be here.

152
00:05:25,294 --> 00:05:25,990
所以这是互动剧院吗
It's interactive?

153
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,884
你个贱逼
You son of a bitch.

154
00:05:28,107 --> 00:05:29,200
那句可以上你们的宣传海报
There's a quote for your poster.

155
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,967
-前门开了  -不是吧
- Front door open. - Ay, no!

156
00:05:35,977 --> 00:05:39,111
拜托  是谁  是谁
Please. Who?! Who?!

157
00:05:39,967 --> 00:05:41,173
你到底还在这里干什么
Ay, what the hell are you doing here?

158
00:05:41,515 --> 00:05:44,013
我刚经历了人生中最尴尬的事
I had the most humiliating experience of my entire life.

159
00:05:44,336 --> 00:05:45,608
我可能永远都不要走出这个家了
I may never leave this house again.

160
00:05:45,628 --> 00:05:46,375
好了  你只是累了
Okay, you're just tired.

161
00:05:46,738 --> 00:05:48,049
我给你倒杯咖啡  你就可以再战了
I'm gonna make you an espresso, and you go back.

162
00:05:48,674 --> 00:05:49,703
不  我不能再去了
No, I can't go back there.

163
00:05:49,925 --> 00:05:52,345
你又因为调节灯光惹麻烦了吗
Did you get in trouble again for adjusting the lighting?

164
00:05:52,728 --> 00:05:53,555
你还年轻
You're still young.

165
00:05:53,596 --> 00:05:54,967
光线亮一点没关系
You can take a bright bulb.

166
00:05:55,149 --> 00:05:56,399
我本来在逗艾娃·莫里斯开心
I was flirting with Ava Morris,

167
00:05:56,459 --> 00:05:57,670
结果小腿胫骨狠狠地撞上了
and I walked into a coffee table

168
00:05:57,710 --> 00:05:59,122
一张咖啡桌
and hit my shin really hard

169
00:05:59,162 --> 00:06:01,270
然后在所有人面前哭出来了
and started crying in front of everyone.

170
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:02,733
已经够惨了吧  然后我发现
Bad enough -- but then I noticed

171
00:06:02,773 --> 00:06:04,428
我不小心洒了点饮料在裤裆处
I spilled my drink on my crotch area,

