525
00:19:03,330 --> 00:19:05,424
不  我不能忍受你在这个俱乐部
No, I can't have you at this club!

526
00:19:05,444 --> 00:19:06,952
这是我的地盘  见鬼
This is my place, damn it.

527
00:19:07,856 --> 00:19:08,319
不
No!

528
00:19:08,339 --> 00:19:09,747
对不起  菲尔
I'm sorry, Phil.

529
00:19:10,370 --> 00:19:11,496
你不能另找一个俱乐部吗
Can't you find another club?

530
00:19:11,516 --> 00:19:13,205
看看我的生活
I mean, look at my life.

531
00:19:13,225 --> 00:19:14,234
我建好了自己的房子
I mean, I built my house,

532
00:19:14,275 --> 00:19:16,112
还没等我住进去  我就结婚了
and before I even lived in it, I got married.

533
00:19:16,133 --> 00:19:16,910
是挺棒的
And that's fantastic.

534
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:18,233
然后我有了自己的书房
And then I have my study,

535
00:19:18,273 --> 00:19:20,130
在那我可以关上门喝一杯苏格兰威士忌
where I can close the door and have a glass of Scotch.

536
00:19:20,373 --> 00:19:22,230
而现在那是乔的房间  也挺好的
And now it's Joe's room, and that's fantastic.

537
00:19:22,493 --> 00:19:24,392
但这里是我仅剩的唯一的
But this is the only place I have left

538
00:19:24,432 --> 00:19:25,945
不用和家人分享的空间
that I don't have to share with my family.

539
00:19:25,965 --> 00:19:29,168
我不想当打断你的白痴  但你发出信息了吗
I don't want to be that guy, but did you send that text yet?

540
00:19:29,410 --> 00:19:30,719
唯一我觉得特别的地方
The one place I feel special --

541
00:19:30,800 --> 00:19:32,753
他们喊我王牌或者杰哥或者普里契
they call me "Ace" and "Jay Boy" and "Pritch."

542
00:19:33,055 --> 00:19:34,848
我在别的地方都没在这里痛快  好吗
I'm not comfortable other places, okay?

543
00:19:35,311 --> 00:19:36,650
而你  你在哪都能融入
But you -- you fit in everywhere.

544
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:38,374
整个世界都是你的俱乐部
The whole world is your club!

545
00:19:38,395 --> 00:19:39,927
但我只有这个地方
But I have this place!

546
00:19:39,968 --> 00:19:41,460
你懂了吧
You get that, right?

547
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:50,077
维护人员一分钟后就到了
Maintenance arrived one minute later

548
00:19:50,137 --> 00:19:51,855
用海鲜吧里的冰块把他包了起来
and packed him in ice from the seafood bar,

549
00:19:51,875 --> 00:19:52,742
然后他就完好如初了
and he was as good as new.

550
00:19:55,071 --> 00:19:55,212
你觉得怎么样
How you feeling?

551
00:19:56,778 --> 00:19:57,019
好点了
Better.

552
00:19:58,425 --> 00:19:59,971
杰  我在想你刚刚说的话
Jay, I was thinking about what you said before.

553
00:19:59,991 --> 00:20:04,365
如此真诚  敏感
It was so honest and sensitive.

554
00:20:04,385 --> 00:20:05,330
和脆弱
And vulnerable.

555
00:20:05,340 --> 00:20:05,919
停
Hey.

556
00:20:06,215 --> 00:20:07,381
这件事天知地知你知我知
No one needs to know about that.

557
00:20:08,286 --> 00:20:09,834
不管怎样  这是你的俱乐部
Anyway, this is your club.

558
00:20:09,955 --> 00:20:11,181
我退出吧
I'm -- I'm dropping out.

559
00:20:11,463 --> 00:20:13,133
不  你和我一样理应享受这一切
Well, you deserve it just as much as I do.

560
00:20:13,153 --> 00:20:13,918
没事的
It's fine.

561
00:20:13,938 --> 00:20:17,540
我不能让你放弃这一切
I can't let you give all this up.

562
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:20,178
拜托  俱乐部里有
For God's sake, there's the club chair

563
00:20:20,279 --> 00:20:22,570
胖子阿巴寇坐著焦急地等待裁决的椅子
Fatty Arbuckle anxiously awaited his verdict.

564
00:20:22,580 --> 00:20:23,790
杰  我是真心的
Jay, I mean it.

565
00:20:24,253 --> 00:20:26,168
好吧  至少让我送你些什么作为补偿
Well, at least let me give you something in return.

566
00:20:26,531 --> 00:20:26,995
你说吧
You name it.

567
00:20:27,398 --> 00:20:27,680
真的吗
Really?

568
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:29,806
-对  -那么
- Yeah. - Well...

569
00:20:30,449 --> 00:20:32,119
我不喜欢你现在超级开心的样子
I don't like how happy you look right now.

570
00:20:33,205 --> 00:20:34,150
这才是活著  不是吗
This is living, huh?

571
00:20:34,653 --> 00:20:36,483
我们得在这待多久
How long do we have this thing for?

572
00:20:36,764 --> 00:20:37,689
只有三个小时
Only three hours.

573
00:20:38,131 --> 00:20:39,055
你看到标志了吗
You saw the sign.

574
00:20:39,095 --> 00:20:40,642
每一跳都有价值
Every bounce counts!

575
00:20:41,104 --> 00:20:41,667
太棒了
Yes!

576
00:20:41,968 --> 00:20:44,510
跳起来  跳啊
Get you some! Get it!

577
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:47,702
我和弗拉德分手的那些事还令我心有余悸
The way things ended with me and Vlad, it always haunted me.

578
00:20:48,830 --> 00:20:49,978
小卡没说错
Cam wasn't wrong about this.

579
00:20:50,038 --> 00:20:50,946
我们买了全票
We paid for the whole seat,

580
00:20:50,966 --> 00:20:52,259
但只看懂了它的边角
but we're only using the edge of it.

581
00:20:52,421 --> 00:20:53,775
你知道吗  我只欠你这么多
You know, I only owe you so much.

582
00:20:54,118 --> 00:20:55,768
我对你的补偿也是有限的
You don't get an unlimited number of these.

583
00:20:55,788 --> 00:20:58,926
泰咪  你绝不会相信谁在这里
Tammy, you are never gonna believe who's here.

584
00:20:59,067 --> 00:20:59,449
-谁  -弗拉德
- Who? - Vlad.

585
00:21:01,199 --> 00:21:02,345
我的天  在哪
Oh, my God, where?

586
00:21:02,365 --> 00:21:03,028
在那里
Out there.

587
00:21:03,671 --> 00:21:04,997
我觉得我得早点溜了
I think might duck out early.

588
00:21:06,424 --> 00:21:08,213
他在那  他就是弗拉德
There he is. That's Vlad.

589
00:21:08,896 --> 00:21:09,780
太幸运了
Lucky!

590
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:13,530
弗拉德  弗拉德  弗拉德
Vlad! Vlad! Vlad! Vlad! Vlad!
